// Aggregate-free sibling of 0533 (`count … formerly Login … == 0`). "No
// Login in the 1h window" needs no aggregation: it is the negation of a
// positive existence. Exercises a negation OUTSIDE a closed `exists` (the
// §7-safe shape). Verdicts must match 0533.

permit (
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"Alert",
    resource
)
when temporal {
    !exists (u: String). formerly within 1h Drupe::Action::"Login"::request{ input.user: u, input.server: context.input.server }};
